  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoons olive oil",
    "6 small red potatoes, sliced",
    "1 cup torn fresh spinach",
    "2 tablespoons sliced green onions",
    "1 teaspoon crushed garlic",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "6 large eggs",
    "0.33333334326744 cup milk",
    "0.5 cup shredded Cheddar cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zDWXPmpDSYkdwLUhoL2y8ilJPA4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/47044-spinach-and-potato-frittata-DDMFS-step-1-113-75e5ac47663d4dbcb5f2d1a31b8ccfd8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/47044/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat olive oil in a medium skillet over medium heat. Cook potatoes in hot oil, stirring occasionally, until tender but firm, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/27FbqiY4EINqadVtQMUNkwEBzmM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/47044-spinach-and-potato-frittata-DDMFS-step-3-116-5ccb702ebc574695ac96ecc1bd74bf13.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/47044/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in spinach, green onions, and garlic. Season with salt and pepper. Cook and stir until spinach is wilted, 1 to 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/L-cZpHRCWQ40ZUsuYqpmoi7vOiI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/47044-spinach-and-potato-frittata-DDMFS-step-5-118-698b796a48334909af675667f1788d97.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/47044/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat together eggs and milk in a medium bowl. Pour over vegetables in the skillet. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese. Reduce heat to low, cover, and cook until eggs are firm, 5 to 7 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UWZeKHIyB9TnNtKt25Tvw9bVrK8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/47044-spinach-and-potato-frittata-DDMFS-step-9-122-afa9c9664adb43a3909332db67d0c05c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/47044/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
